message: "If you use this glossary, please cite it as below."
title: "Japanese–Indonesian Maternal and Child Health Terminology Glossary: A Bidirectional Reference for the Selayar Project"
version: 1.0.0
# date-released: set to the release date (YYYY-MM-DD) when v1.0.0 is published
# doi: add the Zenodo version DOI here after it is reserved
authors:
  - family-names: Masuda
    given-names: Gaku
    affiliation: "Institute of Tropical Medicine, Nagasaki University"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"  # add if available
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Bilingual glossary of Japanese–Indonesian and Indonesian–Japanese terminology
  for maternal and child health, perinatal care, obstetric emergencies, referral
  systems, telemedicine, and healthcare financing. Prepared in connection with
  field research in the Selayar Islands, South Sulawesi, Indonesia. Educational
  reference only; not a substitute for clinical guidelines or professional
  medical interpretation.
keywords:
  - maternal health
  - midwifery
  - perinatal care
  - Japanese
  - Indonesian
  - Selayar
  - telemedicine
